From d634e11770676f5eb7e0d329149eade989f9ce92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Steve Veerman <757767+veerman@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 08:28:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] PlayBook (QNX 6.5 ARMv7) port: JSCOnly builds with GCC 9.3

- OS(QNX) platform macro; machine context via <ucontext.h> cpu.gpr[]
- StackBounds from __tls()/__stackaddr (no pthread_getattr_np)
- No SA_RESTART on QNX (FIXME: replace signal-based GC suspend)
- Skip mincore() paged-out stats (QNX has no swap)
- Skip missing capstone; Ruby 3.4 File.exist?

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
